{
  "info": {
    "name": "Pharmacy & Healthcare Store API",
    "_postman_id": "a9c0b3f1-0a09-4d2e-9f0a-assignment09api",
    "description": "RBAC + JWT Pharmacy API. Covers all three roles (customer, pharmacist, admin) with token headers.\n\nRun requests top-to-bottom. Login requests automatically save the returned JWT into collection variables (customerToken / pharmacistToken / adminToken) and created ids (medicineId / orderId) so later requests are wired up.\n\nNOTE ON STOCK DEDUCTION: Stock is NOT reduced when an order is placed. It is decremented atomically only on the FIRST time an order transitions to 'approved' (via PATCH /orders/:id/status). Re-approving an already-approved order does NOT decrement again. To verify: (1) note a medicine's stockQuantity via GET /medicines, (2) place an order as customer, (3) confirm stock unchanged, (4) approve the order as pharmacist, (5) GET the medicine again and confirm stock dropped by the ordered quantity, (6) approve again and confirm no further change.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:5000" },
    { "key": "adminSecret", "value": "super_secret_admin_key" },
    { "key": "customerToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "pharmacistToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "adminToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "medicineId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "orderId", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register Customer (public)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "register"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Cara Customer\",\n  \"email\": \"cara.customer@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Register Staff - Pharmacist (needs ADMIN_SECRET_KEY)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('pharmacistToken', pm.response.json().data.token);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "x-admin-secret", "value": "{{adminSecret}}" }
            ],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register-staff", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "register-staff"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Phil Pharmacist\",\n  \"email\": \"phil.pharmacist@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\",\n  \"role\": \"pharmacist\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Register Staff - Admin (needs ADMIN_SECRET_KEY)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('adminToken', pm.response.json().data.token);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "x-admin-secret", "value": "{{adminSecret}}" }
            ],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register-staff", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "register-staff"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Ada Admin\",\n  \"email\": \"ada.admin@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\",\n  \"role\": \"admin\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Register Staff - WRONG secret (expect 403)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "x-admin-secret", "value": "wrong_key" }
            ],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register-staff", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "register-staff"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Mal Actor\",\n  \"email\": \"mal@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\",\n  \"role\": \"admin\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login Customer",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('customerToken', pm.response.json().data.token);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "login"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"cara.customer@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login Pharmacist",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('pharmacistToken', pm.response.json().data.token);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "login"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"phil.pharmacist@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login Admin",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('adminToken', pm.response.json().data.token);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "login"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"ada.admin@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Profile (customer)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{customerToken}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/profile", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "profile"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Medicines",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Medicines (public, search+category)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/medicines?search=para&category=Analgesic",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "medicines"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "search", "value": "para" },
                { "key": "category", "value": "Analgesic" }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Add Medicine as Pharmacist (201)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('medicineId', pm.response.json().data._id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{pharmacistToken}}" }
            ],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/medicines", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "medicines"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Paracetamol 500mg\",\n  \"brand\": \"Calpol\",\n  \"category\": \"Analgesic\",\n  \"dosageForm\": \"Tablet\",\n  \"price\": 25,\n  \"stockQuantity\": 100,\n  \"requiresPrescription\": false,\n  \"expiryDate\": \"2026-10-01\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Add Prescription Medicine as Pharmacist (201)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{pharmacistToken}}" }
            ],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/medicines", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "medicines"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Amoxicillin 250mg\",\n  \"brand\": \"Mox\",\n  \"category\": \"Antibiotic\",\n  \"dosageForm\": \"Capsule\",\n  \"price\": 80,\n  \"stockQuantity\": 40,\n  \"requiresPrescription\": true,\n  \"expiryDate\": \"2026-09-20\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Add Medicine as Customer (expect 403)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{customerToken}}" }
            ],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/medicines", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "medicines"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Should Fail\",\n  \"brand\": \"X\",\n  \"category\": \"Y\",\n  \"dosageForm\": \"Tablet\",\n  \"price\": 10,\n  \"stockQuantity\": 5,\n  \"expiryDate\": \"2026-12-01\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Medicine stock/price as Pharmacist",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{pharmacistToken}}" }
            ],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/medicines/{{medicineId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "medicines", "{{medicineId}}"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"stockQuantity\": 120,\n  \"price\": 27\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Expiring-soon report (pharmacist/admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{pharmacistToken}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/medicines/expiring", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "medicines", "expiring"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Expiring-soon as Customer (expect 403)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{customerToken}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/medicines/expiring", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "medicines", "expiring"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete Medicine as Admin (admin only)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/medicines/{{medicineId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "medicines", "{{medicineId}}"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete Medicine as Pharmacist (expect 403)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{pharmacistToken}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/medicines/{{medicineId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "medicines", "{{medicineId}}"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Orders",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Place Order as Customer (201)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('orderId', pm.response.json().data._id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{customerToken}}" }
            ],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/orders", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "orders"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"items\": [\n    { \"medicine\": \"{{medicineId}}\", \"quantity\": 3 }\n  ],\n  \"prescriptionNotes\": \"\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "unitPrice and totalAmount are computed server-side from current medicine price. Stock is NOT decremented here."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Place Order as Pharmacist (expect 403)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{pharmacistToken}}" }
            ],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/orders", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "orders"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"items\": [ { \"medicine\": \"{{medicineId}}\", \"quantity\": 1 } ]\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "My Orders (customer only)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{customerToken}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/orders/my-orders", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "orders", "my-orders"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "All Orders (pharmacist/admin, ?status filter)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{pharmacistToken}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/orders?status=pending",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "orders"],
              "query": [{ "key": "status", "value": "pending" }]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Approve Order as Pharmacist (decrements stock ONCE)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{pharmacistToken}}" }
            ],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/status", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "orders", "{{orderId}}", "status"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"approved\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "STOCK DEDUCTION EXPECTATION: On this first approval, each item's medicine.stockQuantity is atomically reduced by the ordered quantity (guarded by { stockQuantity: { $gte: quantity } }). Verify with GET /api/medicines afterward: the medicine used above should drop by 3."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Re-approve Order (NO double decrement)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{pharmacistToken}}" }
            ],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/status", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "orders", "{{orderId}}", "status"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"approved\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Re-approving must NOT decrement stock again (guarded by order.stockDeducted). Verify medicine stock is unchanged vs. after the first approval."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Dispense Order as Admin",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}" }
            ],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/status", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "orders", "{{orderId}}", "status"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"dispensed\"\n}"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
